---
/**
 * Consultations section — static Astro port of src/components/Consultations.tsx.
 * Zero React/framer-motion: entrance fades are CSS keyframes (reduced-motion
 * aware). Both card CTAs pointed to #contacto in the old code; per the
 * migration plan (finding D6) they now open the intake flow via
 * `data-open-flow`.
 */
---

<section id="consultas" class="py-24 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    {/* Header */}
    <div class="anim-fade-up text-center mb-16">
      <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-accent-100 text-accent-600 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full mb-4">
        Tipos de Consulta
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">
        ¿Desea consultar su caso laboral <span class="text-accent-500">con un abogado?</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Elige el tipo de consulta que mejor se adapte a tu situación.
        Tu primera defensa comienza con información.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Cards */}
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      {/* Consulta General */}
      <div class="anim-fade-up anim-delay-0 relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-white border-2 border-gray-100 shadow-lg">
        <div class="p-8">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2 text-gray-900">Consulta General</h3>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-4">
              <span class="text-5xl font-bold text-primary-600">$400</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">MXN</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-600">
              ¿Necesitas orientación sobre tus derechos laborales? Ideal para cualquier situación que no sea despido.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-8">
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 text-gray-500">
              Esta consulta te ofrece:
            </h4>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-green-100">
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-green-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-700">Diagnóstico profesional de tu caso</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-green-100">
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-green-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-700">Revisión de documentación laboral</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-green-100">
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-green-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-700">Identificación de violaciones a tus derechos</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-green-100">
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-green-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-700">Estrategia legal personalizada</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-green-100">
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-green-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-700">Presupuesto transparente si decides continuar</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-8">
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 text-gray-500">
              Temas que atendemos:
            </h4>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 text-xs rounded-full">Acoso laboral y hostigamiento</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 text-xs rounded-full">Reducción de salario o prestaciones</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 text-xs rounded-full">Cambios en condiciones de trabajo</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 text-xs rounded-full">Incapacidades médicas y derechos</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 text-xs rounded-full">Derechos de seguridad social</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 text-xs rounded-full">Constitución de sindicatos</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 text-xs rounded-full">Riesgos de trabajo</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 text-xs rounded-full">Pensiones por invalidez, viudez, orfandad</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <button
            type="button"
            data-open-flow="consultas-general"
            class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg transition-all bg-primary-600 text-white hover:bg-primary-700 cursor-pointer"
          >
            Agendar Consulta
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M5 12h14" />
              <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7" />
            </svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Consulta por Despido */}
      <div class="anim-fade-up anim-delay-1 relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-600 to-primary-800 text-white shadow-2xl shadow-primary-600/30 scale-[1.02]">
        {/* Featured Badge */}
        <div class="absolute top-6 right-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-yellow-300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z" />
              <path d="M20 3v4" />
              <path d="M22 5h-4" />
              <path d="M4 17v2" />
              <path d="M5 18H3" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Recomendado</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2 text-white">Consulta por Despido</h3>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-4">
              <span class="text-5xl font-bold text-white">GRATIS</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-white/70">Sin costo</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-white/80">
              ¿Te despidieron o quieren que renuncies? Evaluación completa de tu situación SIN COSTO.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-8">
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 text-white/70">
              Esta consulta te ofrece:
            </h4>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-white/20">
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-white" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="text-sm text-white/90">Diagnóstico experto de tu despido</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-white/20">
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-white" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="text-sm text-white/90">Cálculo exacto de tu indemnización legal</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-white/20">
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-white" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="text-sm text-white/90">Análisis de tu finiquito ofrecido</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-white/20">
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-white" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="text-sm text-white/90">Identificación de irregularidades patronales</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-white/20">
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-white" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="text-sm text-white/90">Plan de acción claro y concreto</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-8 p-4 bg-white/10 rounded-xl">
            <p class="text-sm text-white/80 italic">
              "Creemos que todo trabajador merece saber si sus derechos fueron vulnerados, sin costo alguno. Si tu caso procede, trabajamos con honorarios basados en resultados."
            </p>
          </div>

          <button
            type="button"
            data-open-flow="consultas-despido"
            class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg transition-all bg-white text-primary-700 hover:bg-gray-100 cursor-pointer"
          >
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2" />
            </svg>
            Obtener Consulta Gratis
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M5 12h14" />
              <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7" />
            </svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Entrance fade-up (replaces framer-motion whileInView) */
  @keyframes fade-up {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(30px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
  .anim-fade-up {
    animation: fade-up 0.5s ease-out both;
  }
  .anim-delay-0 { animation-delay: 0s; }
  .anim-delay-1 { animation-delay: 0.1s; }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .anim-fade-up {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>